    "overview": "Each project folder on CloudFront should have index.txt files like ScannedReality does",
    "howToAddNewProject": [
      "1. On CloudFront, create a project folder (e.g., 'HolocaustSurvivors')",
      "2. Add an index.txt at project level listing all sessions",
      "3. For each session folder, add index.txt listing all recordings",
      "4. Add the project to this file pointing to its index.txt"
